{
  "uid": "labkit-providers",
  "title": "labkit providers",
  "description": "Requests, tokens and cost of each provider the labkit harness asked, by day and by hour of day, from Tempo's agent.model.request spans; omp's stats Providers. Source: scripts/observability/labkit-providers-dashboard.json.",
  "tags": [
    "labkit"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "",
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "labkit"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "title": "labkit dashboards",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"labkit-.*\"}, service)",
          "refId": "service"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "labkit-.*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "burn",
        "label": "Burn",
        "type": "custom",
        "description": "What the daily burn chart shows.",
        "query": "tokens : span.unset_tokens_gate,cost : span.unset_cost_gate,requests : name",
        "current": {
          "text": "tokens",
          "value": "span.unset_tokens_gate"
        },
        "options": [],
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Provider totals",
      "description": "For each provider, over agent.model.request spans: requests; failed (outcome = failed) and error rate (failed ÷ requests); tokens (input + output); cost (span.cost_usd of priced responses); cache rate (cache read ÷ (uncached input + cache read)); tokens/s (mean of span.tokens_per_second); TTFT (mean of span.ttft_ms). omp's Models column (distinct models) is not here: Tempo's metrics cannot count distinct values; the Models dashboard lists them. Each provider's share of tokens and cost is in the charts beside it. omp's Premium column (GitHub Copilot) and subscription windows (OAuth accounts) are not ported: labkit uses API keys.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Requests_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\"} | count_over_time() by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "Requests",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "Requests_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "dropNN"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "Cost_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.cost_usd != nil && span.priced = true} | sum_over_time(span.cost_usd) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "Cost",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "Cost_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "dropNN"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "in_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.input_tokens != nil} | sum_over_time(span.input_tokens) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "in",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "in_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "replaceNN",
            "replaceWithValue": 0
          },
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "out_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.output_tokens != nil} | sum_over_time(span.output_tokens) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "out",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "out_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "replaceNN",
            "replaceWithValue": 0
          },
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Tokens",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "math",
          "expression": "$in + $out"
        },
        {
          "refId": "cr_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.cache_read_tokens != nil} | sum_over_time(span.cache_read_tokens) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "cr",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "cr_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "replaceNN",
            "replaceWithValue": 0
          },
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "unc_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.uncached_input_tokens != nil} | sum_over_time(span.uncached_input_tokens) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "unc",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "unc_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "replaceNN",
            "replaceWithValue": 0
          },
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "CacheRate",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "math",
          "expression": "$cr / ($unc + $cr)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "f_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.outcome = \"failed\"} | count_over_time() by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "f",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "f_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "replaceNN",
            "replaceWithValue": 0
          },
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Failed",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "f_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "replaceNN",
            "replaceWithValue": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "Errors",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "math",
          "expression": "$f / $Requests"
        },
        {
          "refId": "TokensPerSecond_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.tokens_per_second != nil} | avg_over_time(span.tokens_per_second) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "TokensPerSecond",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "TokensPerSecond_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "dropNN"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "TTFT_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.ttft_ms != nil} | avg_over_time(span.ttft_ms) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "TTFT",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "TTFT_q",
          "reducer": "last",
          "settings": {
            "mode": "dropNN"
          }
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {
            "mode": "columns"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "span.provider": 0,
              "Requests": 1,
              "Failed": 2,
              "Errors": 3,
              "Tokens": 4,
              "Cost": 5,
              "CacheRate": 6,
              "TokensPerSecond": 7,
              "TTFT": 8
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "span.model": "Model",
              "span.provider": "Provider",
              "span.cwd": "Folder",
              "CacheRate": "Cache rate",
              "TokensPerSecond": "Tokens/s",
              "TTFT": "TTFT",
              "Errors": "Error rate"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Tokens",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "span.provider"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "regex",
                    "options": {
                      "pattern": "^\"(.*)\"$",
                      "result": {
                        "text": "$1",
                        "index": 0
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Requests"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "basic",
                  "valueDisplayMode": "text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Cost"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "currencyUSD"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Tokens"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CacheRate"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Errors"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "noValue",
                "value": "0%"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "TokensPerSecond"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "TTFT"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "noValue",
                "value": "0"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Token share",
      "description": "Each provider's share of the tokens (span.input_tokens + span.output_tokens) of agent.model.request spans.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "input_tokens_q",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && name=\"agent.model.request\" && span.input_tokens != nil} | sum_over_time(span.input_tokens) by (span.provider)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "hide": true,
          "limit": 100
        },
        {
          "refId": "input_tokens",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
